###  https://natclinn.github.io/hasCiqualFoodCode
<https://natclinn.github.io/hasCiqualFoodCode> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                               rdfs:domain <https://natclinn.github.io/Ingredient> ;
                                               rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                                               rdfs:comment "Ciqual code for a food industry product."@en ,
                                                            "Code Ciqual d'un produit de l'industrie agroalimentaire."@fr ;
